{"findings": [{"finding_id": "DD-1", "drift_kind": "other", "explanation": "The `select_address_family` docstring names `AF_INET4`, but the implementation returns `socket.AF_INET` (there is no `AF_INET4` in the returned code paths).", "doc_citation": {"path": "werkzeug/src/werkzeug/serving.py", "start_line": 655, "end_line": 655, "quote": """"Return ``AF_INET4``, ``AF_INET6``, or ``AF_UNIX`` depending on"}, "code_citation": {"path": "werkzeug/src/werkzeug/serving.py", "start_line": 657, "end_line": 661, "quote": "if host.startswith("unix://"):
